  maxHealth: 2
  moveSpeed: 1.9
  scoreValue: 150
  contactDamage: 1
  description: A spider that learned doubt, or a witch that learned silk. She swings
    across the sky as she falls, spinning the answer either way.
  tactics: Weaves side to side while dropping and lobs a small green arc downward.
    Its position is predictable - a smooth sine - so lead it slightly when you shoot.
    The arc punishes you for standing still; keep drifting and it never touches you.
